        <p
          class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300"
        >
          Your map is yours to clear whenever you like, from the cookies page. Wherever you live, you can also ask me what I hold about you, and ask me to correct or delete it. Depending on where you live, you may also be able to complain to a privacy regulator.
